  0 0 1 0 90 arc tMatrix setmatrix ulx hradius add lry vradius sub
  translate hradius vradius scale 0 0 1 90 180 arc tMatrix setmatrix
  closepath} bdef
/FRR {MRR stroke } bdef
/PRR {MRR fill } bdef
